    {
     "type": "concept",
     "title": "Auditing With the Brand Script",
     "content": "Once your Brand Script exists, every existing asset becomes auditable. Take any landing page, ad, or email. Highlight where it serves each of the 7 elements. Gaps reveal weak spots. Overlaps reveal redundancy. The Brand Script becomes your editorial standard, your brief, your QA checklist.",
     "visual": {
      "type": "diagram",
      "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><rect width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"70\" font-size=\"36\" fill=\"#ffd700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">Auditing With the Script</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"115\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#a0a0c0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Editorial standard · brief · QA checklist</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"220\" font-size=\"26\" fill=\"#4fc3f7\" text-anchor=\"middle\">The 7-Highlighter Audit</text><rect x=\"100\" y=\"260\" width=\"900\" height=\"80\" fill=\"#2a2a4e\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"2\" rx=\"10\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"305\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#ffd700\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Yellow = Character</text><rect x=\"100\" y=\"350\" width=\"900\" height=\"80\" fill=\"#2a2a4e\" stroke=\"#ef4444\" stroke-width=\"2\" rx=\"10\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"395\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#ef4444\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Red = Problem</text><rect x=\"100\" y=\"440\" width=\"900\" height=\"80\" fill=\"#2a2a4e\" stroke=\"#81c784\" stroke-width=\"2\" rx=\"10\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"485\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#81c784\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Green = Guide</text><rect x=\"100\" y=\"530\" width=\"900\" height=\"80\" fill=\"#2a2a4e\" stroke=\"#4fc3f7\" stroke-width=\"2\" rx=\"10\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"575\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#4fc3f7\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Blue = Plan</text><rect x=\"100\" y=\"620\" width=\"900\" height=\"80\" fill=\"#2a2a4e\" stroke=\"#ba68c8\" stroke-width=\"2\" rx=\"10\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"665\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#ba68c8\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Purple = CTA</text><rect x=\"100\" y=\"710\" width=\"900\" height=\"80\" fill=\"#2a2a4e\" stroke=\"#ff8a65\" stroke-width=\"2\" rx=\"10\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"755\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#ff8a65\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Orange = Stakes</text><rect x=\"100\" y=\"800\" width=\"900\" height=\"80\" fill=\"#2a2a4e\" stroke=\"#a0a0c0\" stroke-width=\"2\" rx=\"10\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"845\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">White = Success</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"950\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffd700\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Missing colors = missing elements.</text></svg>",
      "caption": "Seven highlighters. One audit. Every asset."
     }
    },
    {
     "type": "quiz",
     "question": "After someone takes a TRANSITIONAL CTA, what should fire?",
     "options": [
      {
       "text": "Nothing — they need space",
       "correct": false
      },
      {
       "text": "A single follow-up email",
       "correct": false
      },
      {
       "text": "A 5-email nurture sequence that walks the Brand Script",
       "correct": true
      },
      {
       "text": "An immediate phone call",
       "correct": false
      }
     ],
     "explanation": "Transitional CTAs warm not-yet-ready buyers. A 5-email sequence drips the Brand Script (problem, empathy, plan, stakes, direct CTA) over 8 days — converting 3-7x better than a single follow-up.",
     "visual": {
      "type": "diagram",
      "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><rect width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"70\" font-size=\"36\" fill=\"#ffd700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">Quiz: Nurture Trigger</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"115\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#a0a0c0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">After transitional CTA</text><rect x=\"100\" y=\"350\" width=\"900\" height=\"280\" fill=\"#2a2a4e\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"4\" rx=\"20\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"430\" font-size=\"32\" fill=\"#ffd700\" text-anchor=\"middle\">5-EMAIL SEQUENCE</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"490\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Problem · Empathy · Plan</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"530\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Stakes · Direct CTA</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"580\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#a0a0c0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">8 days, one Brand Script element per email</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"800\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">3-7x better conversion than single follow-up.</text></svg>",
      "caption": "Five emails. Eight days. The whole script."
     }
    },
    {
     "type": "concept",
     "title": "Living the Brand Script",
     "content": "A Brand Script is not a launch document — it's an operating system. Quarterly: re-test with customer interviews. Annually: refresh stakes and success vision as customers evolve. When the script changes, every asset gets re-audited. Discipline of one Brand Script is what separates brands that compound from brands that drift.",
     "visual": {
      "type": "diagram",
      "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><rect width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"70\" font-size=\"36\" fill=\"#ffd700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">Living the Brand Script</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"115\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#a0a0c0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">An operating system, not a launch doc</text><rect x=\"100\" y=\"220\" width=\"900\" height=\"180\" fill=\"#2a2a4e\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"2\" rx=\"10\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"270\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffd700\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Quarterly</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"320\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Re-test with 5 customer interviews.</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"360\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#a0a0c0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Are the problem layers still accurate?</text><rect x=\"100\" y=\"420\" width=\"900\" height=\"180\" fill=\"#2a2a4e\" stroke=\"#81c784\" stroke-width=\"2\" rx=\"10\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"470\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#81c784\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Annually</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"520\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Refresh stakes and success vision.</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"560\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#a0a0c0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Customers evolve; so should the language.</text><rect x=\"100\" y=\"620\" width=\"900\" height=\"180\" fill=\"#2a2a4e\" stroke=\"#4fc3f7\" stroke-width=\"2\" rx=\"10\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"670\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#4fc3f7\" text-anchor=\"middle\">When the script changes</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"720\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Re-audit every asset.</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"760\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#a0a0c0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Drift kills brands. Discipline compounds them.</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"920\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffd700\" text-anchor=\"middle\">One Brand Script. Reviewed quarterly. Lived daily.</text></svg>",
      "caption": "Brands that compound: live the script."
     }
    },
    {
     "type": "practice",
     "title": "Practice 1: Full Brand Script",
     "content": "Sit down with your real brand (or capstone project). Complete a full Brand Script — every one of the seven boxes filled in. Use the worked example as a guide. Constraints: every word must pass the bumper-sticker test. Print the page. Tape it above your desk for the rest of the semester. This single page is the most valuable artifact you'll leave this course with.",
     "visual": {
      "type": "diagram",
      "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><rect width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"70\" font-size=\"36\" fill=\"#ffd700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">Practice 1: Brand Script</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"115\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#a0a0c0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Seven boxes. Real brand. Fill all.</text><rect x=\"100\" y=\"180\" width=\"900\" height=\"90\" fill=\"#2a2a4e\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"2\" rx=\"10\"/><text x=\"120\" y=\"220\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#ffd700\">1. CHARACTER:</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"250\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#ffffff\">__________________________________________</text><rect x=\"100\" y=\"280\" width=\"900\" height=\"90\" fill=\"#2a2a4e\" stroke=\"#ef4444\" stroke-width=\"2\" rx=\"10\"/><text x=\"120\" y=\"320\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#ef4444\">2. PROBLEM (villain/ext/int/philo):</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"350\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#ffffff\">__________________________________________</text><rect x=\"100\" y=\"380\" width=\"900\" height=\"90\" fill=\"#2a2a4e\" stroke=\"#81c784\" stroke-width=\"2\" rx=\"10\"/><text x=\"120\" y=\"420\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#81c784\">3. GUIDE (empathy/authority):</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"450\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#ffffff\">__________________________________________</text><rect x=\"100\" y=\"480\" width=\"900\" height=\"90\" fill=\"#2a2a4e\" stroke=\"#4fc3f7\" stroke-width=\"2\" rx=\"10\"/><text x=\"120\" y=\"520\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#4fc3f7\">4. PLAN (3 steps + agreement):</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"550\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#ffffff\">__________________________________________</text><rect x=\"100\" y=\"580\" width=\"900\" height=\"90\" fill=\"#2a2a4e\" stroke=\"#ba68c8\" stroke-width=\"2\" rx=\"10\"/><text x=\"120\" y=\"620\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#ba68c8\">5. CTA (direct/transitional):</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"650\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#ffffff\">__________________________________________</text><rect x=\"100\" y=\"680\" width=\"900\" height=\"90\" fill=\"#2a2a4e\" stroke=\"#ef4444\" stroke-width=\"2\" rx=\"10\"/><text x=\"120\" y=\"720\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#ef4444\">6. AVOIDS FAILURE (one-line stakes):</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"750\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#ffffff\">__________________________________________</text><rect x=\"100\" y=\"780\" width=\"900\" height=\"90\" fill=\"#2a2a4e\" stroke=\"#81c784\" stroke-width=\"2\" rx=\"10\"/><text x=\"120\" y=\"820\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#81c784\">7. SUCCESS (identity + scene):</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"850\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#ffffff\">__________________________________________</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"950\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffd700\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Print. Tape above desk. Live by it.</text></svg>",
      "caption": "The most valuable artifact you'll keep."
     }
    },
    {
     "type": "practice",
     "title": "Practice 2: One-Liner + Tagline Drill",
     "content": "From your Brand Script, write TEN one-liner candidates using the formula. Read each aloud. Pick the version that survives a deep breath. Then write TEN tagline candidates (3-6 words each). Choose the one that names either the identity or the villain. Submit your best one-liner and tagline to a classmate; ask them what they think you do. If they guess wrong, revise.",
     "visual": {
      "type": "diagram",
      "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><rect width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"70\" font-size=\"36\" fill=\"#ffd700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">Practice 2: One-Liner + Tagline</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"115\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#a0a0c0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Ten candidates each. Pick one each.</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"200\" font-size=\"26\" fill=\"#ffd700\" text-anchor=\"middle\">10 One-Liner Drafts</text><rect x=\"100\" y=\"240\" width=\"900\" height=\"40\" fill=\"#2a2a4e\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"2\" rx=\"5\"/><text x=\"120\" y=\"270\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#ffffff\">1. _________________________________________</text><rect x=\"100\" y=\"290\" width=\"900\" height=\"40\" fill=\"#2a2a4e\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"2\" rx=\"5\"/><text x=\"120\" y=\"320\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#ffffff\">2. _________________________________________</text><rect x=\"100\" y=\"340\" width=\"900\" height=\"40\" fill=\"#2a2a4e\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"2\" rx=\"5\"/><text x=\"120\" y=\"370\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#ffffff\">3. _________________________________________</text><rect x=\"100\" y=\"390\" width=\"900\" height=\"40\" fill=\"#2a2a4e\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"2\" rx=\"5\"/><text x=\"120\" y=\"420\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#ffffff\">4-10. ________________________________________</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"500\" font-size=\"26\" fill=\"#81c784\" text-anchor=\"middle\">10 Tagline Drafts (3-6 words)</text><rect x=\"100\" y=\"540\" width=\"900\" height=\"40\" fill=\"#2a2a4e\" stroke=\"#81c784\" stroke-width=\"2\" rx=\"5\"/><text x=\"120\" y=\"570\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#ffffff\">1. _____________________</text><rect x=\"100\" y=\"590\" width=\"900\" height=\"40\" fill=\"#2a2a4e\" stroke=\"#81c784\" stroke-width=\"2\" rx=\"5\"/><text x=\"120\" y=\"620\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#ffffff\">2. _____________________</text><rect x=\"100\" y=\"640\" width=\"900\" height=\"40\" fill=\"#2a2a4e\" stroke=\"#81c784\" stroke-width=\"2\" rx=\"5\"/><text x=\"120\" y=\"670\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#ffffff\">3. _____________________</text><rect x=\"100\" y=\"690\" width=\"900\" height=\"40\" fill=\"#2a2a4e\" stroke=\"#81c784\" stroke-width=\"2\" rx=\"5\"/><text x=\"120\" y=\"720\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#ffffff\">4-10. ____________________</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"820\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffd700\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Submit best one of each to a classmate.</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"870\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Ask: \"What do you think I do?\"</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"920\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#81c784\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Wrong answer = revise. Right = ship.</text></svg>",
      "caption": "Quantity to quality. Then test with a stranger."
     }
    },
    {
     "type": "practice",
     "title": "Practice 3: Wireframe + Email Sequence + 60-Second Pitch",
     "content": "Three deliverables, one capstone. (A) Sketch your 8-section homepage wireframe — section labels and one-line content for each. (B) Outline your 5-email nurture sequence — for each: subject line + one-sentence purpose. (C) Write out your 60-second sales pitch and rehearse aloud, timing yourself. Submit the wireframe, the email outline, and a recording of your pitch. This is your Brand Script in action.",
     "visual": {
      "type": "diagram",
      "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><rect width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"70\" font-size=\"36\" fill=\"#ffd700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">Practice 3: Three Assets</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"115\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#a0a0c0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Wireframe · Emails · Pitch</text><rect x=\"100\" y=\"200\" width=\"900\" height=\"220\" fill=\"#2a2a4e\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"2\" rx=\"10\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"250\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#ffd700\" text-anchor=\"middle\">(A) HOMEPAGE WIREFRAME</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"300\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">8 sections · section labels + 1-line content</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"345\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#a0a0c0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Hero / stakes / value / guide / plan</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"375\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#a0a0c0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">explanation / success / junk drawer</text><rect x=\"100\" y=\"440\" width=\"900\" height=\"220\" fill=\"#2a2a4e\" stroke=\"#81c784\" stroke-width=\"2\" rx=\"10\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"490\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#81c784\" text-anchor=\"middle\">(B) 5-EMAIL SEQUENCE OUTLINE</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"540\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Per email: subject line + 1-sentence purpose</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"585\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#a0a0c0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Problem · Empathy · Plan</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"615\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#a0a0c0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Stakes · Direct CTA</text><rect x=\"100\" y=\"680\" width=\"900\" height=\"220\" fill=\"#2a2a4e\" stroke=\"#4fc3f7\" stroke-width=\"2\" rx=\"10\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"730\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#4fc3f7\" text-anchor=\"middle\">(C) 60-SECOND SALES PITCH</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"780\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Write · rehearse aloud · time yourself</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"825\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#a0a0c0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">10s problem · 10s empathy+authority</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"855\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#a0a0c0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">20s plan+success · 10s ask · 10s buffer</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"960\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffd700\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Submit all three. Your script — in action.</text></svg>",
      "caption": "Three artifacts — your Brand Script made operational."
     }
    },
    {
     "type": "quiz",
     "question": "What is the FIRST step in living the Brand Script post-launch?",
     "options": [
      {
       "text": "Quarterly customer interviews to retest each box",
       "correct": true
      },
      {
       "text": "Rebrand every six months",
       "correct": false
      },
      {
       "text": "Stop using the Brand Script after launch",
       "correct": false
      },
      {
       "text": "Hire a new agency",
       "correct": false
      }
     ],
     "explanation": "A Brand Script is an operating system. Quarterly customer interviews keep the problem/identity language accurate as customers evolve. Without this loop, scripts drift toward marketing-speak again.",
     "visual": {
      "type": "diagram",
      "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><rect width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"70\" font-size=\"36\" fill=\"#ffd700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">Quiz: Living the Script</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"115\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#a0a0c0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Quarterly customer interviews</text><circle cx=\"550\" cy=\"500\" r=\"220\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"6\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"470\" font-size=\"28\" fill=\"#ffd700\" text-anchor=\"middle\">QUARTERLY</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"520\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">5 customer interviews</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"560\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#a0a0c0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">retest each of 7 boxes</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"800\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Without the loop, scripts drift.</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"950\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffd700\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Disciplined brands compound.</text></svg>",
      "caption": "The loop is the discipline."
     }
    },
    {
     "type": "quiz",
     "question": "Which line is the BEST one-liner for our worked example (bootstrapped-SaaS coaching firm)?",
     "options": [
      {
       "text": "We're the premier coaching firm for SaaS leaders",
       "correct": false
      },
      {
       "text": "Most bootstrapped founders struggle with empty pipelines. We help them close their first 10 customers in 90 days so they can become profitable operators.",
       "correct": true
      },
      {
       "text": "Coaching + community + content for founders",
       "correct": false
      },
      {
       "text": "Helping startups since 2018",
       "correct": false
      }
     ],
     "explanation": "The winning option uses the four-slot formula: HERO (bootstrapped founders), PROBLEM (empty pipelines), OUTCOME (close first 10 in 90 days), SUCCESS (profitable operators). It's the script compressed.",
     "visual": {
      "type": "diagram",
      "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><rect width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"70\" font-size=\"36\" fill=\"#ffd700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">Quiz: Best One-Liner</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"115\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#a0a0c0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Four slots filled</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"300\" width=\"940\" height=\"380\" fill=\"#2a2a4e\" stroke=\"#81c784\" stroke-width=\"4\" rx=\"20\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"365\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#81c784\" text-anchor=\"middle\">\"Most bootstrapped founders</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"400\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#81c784\" text-anchor=\"middle\">struggle with empty pipelines.</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"465\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">We help them close their first 10 customers</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"500\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">in 90 days</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"555\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffd700\" text-anchor=\"middle\">so they can become</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"590\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffd700\" text-anchor=\"middle\">profitable operators.\"</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"650\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#a0a0c0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Hero · Problem · Outcome · Success</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"850\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">The Brand Script compressed.</text></svg>",
      "caption": "Four slots filled — every time."
     }
    },
    {
     "type": "quote",
     "title": "Course Closer",
     "content": "\"Story is the most powerful tool in the world for capturing and holding attention. If you communicate using the framework of a story, customers will listen — not because story is a trick, but because story is how the brain organizes meaning. Your job is not to be cleverer than your competitors. Your job is to be CLEARER.\" — Donald Miller. You now have the framework. The rest is craft.",
     "visual": {
      "type": "diagram",
      "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><rect width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"70\" font-size=\"36\" fill=\"#ffd700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">Course Closer</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"115\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#a0a0c0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Clarity, not cleverness</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"240\" width=\"940\" height=\"600\" fill=\"#2a2a4e\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"4\" rx=\"20\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"300\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffd700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-style=\"italic\">\"Story is the most powerful tool</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"335\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffd700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-style=\"italic\">for capturing and holding attention.\"</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"410\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-style=\"italic\">If you communicate using story,</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"445\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-style=\"italic\">customers will listen —</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"480\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-style=\"italic\">not because story is a trick,</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"515\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-style=\"italic\">but because story is how the brain</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"550\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-style=\"italic\">organizes meaning.</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"625\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#81c784\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-style=\"italic\">Your job is not to be cleverer.</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"660\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#81c784\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-style=\"italic\">Your job is to be CLEARER.</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"740\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#a0a0c0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">— Donald Miller</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"800\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#ffd700\" text-anchor=\"middle\">You have the framework. The rest is craft.</text></svg>",
      "caption": "End of seminar. Beginning of practice."
     }
    }
